  "description": "Boost your developer productivity without leaving the app you're working in. Select any text and instantly transform it with powerful everyday tools:\n          \n          • JSON formatting, sorting & conversion to YAML or XML\n          • XML formatting & pretty-printing\n          • Base64 decoding\n          • Text unescaping (HTML, URL & more)\n          \n          Inspired by DevToys, this extension brings essential developer utilities right to your fingertips — no context-switching required.",
